  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "瑪琪艾兒小姐的代理人\n就是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "746A742A827E51525C0F59D076844EE374064EBA000A5C31662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3554A300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼事不宜遲，\n請聽聽我的委託！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A39EBC4E8B4E0D5B9C9072FF0C000A8ACB807D807D6211768459D48A17FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我對寶可夢的進化有興趣……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C0D5BF653EF5922768490325316670982088DA32026202600100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳知道什麼是寶可夢的進化吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n透過對戰獲得經驗值，\n或是感情變得要好後，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n寶可夢就會進化，外貌改變而且變得更強……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B377E590534EC09EBC662F5BF653EF59227684903253165427FF1F00100001BE01000A900F904E5C0D623073725F977D939A57503CFF0C000A6216662F611F60C58B8A5F978981597D5F8CFF0C00100001BE00000A5BF653EF59225C31670390325316FF0C59168C8C65398B8A800C4E148B8A5F9766F45F372026202600100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在幾個不同的進化方法中，\n我對使用道具進化的方式特別感興趣。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57285E7E500B4E0D540C76849032531665B96CD54E2DFF0C000A62115C0D4F7F75289053517790325316768465B95F0F72795225611F82088DA3300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而我弄到手的就是\n這個「雷之石」！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C62115F045230624B76845C31662F000A9019500B300C96F74E4B77F3300DFF01FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但很可惜的是，\n我本人……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465F8853EF60DC7684662FFF0C000A6211672C4EBA2026202600100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身邊沒有能使用\n雷之石進化的寶可夢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB908A6C92670980FD4F7F7528000A96F74E4B77F39032531676845BF653EF5922300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "經過我的調查，有一種叫做\n皮卡丘的寶可夢能用雷之石進化。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7D93904E621176848ABF67E5FF0C67094E007A2E53EB505A000A76AE53614E1876845BF653EF592280FD752896F74E4B77F390325316300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "現在我們終於要進入正題了。\n拜託了！請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳給我皮卡丘吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE5728621150117D4265BC8981903251656B63984C4E863002000A62DC8A174E86FF018ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B37D66621176AE53614E185427FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我當然不會白要的！\n作為代替我會給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳赫拉克羅斯。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n簡單來說就是寶可夢交換！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211757671364E0D6703767D89817684FF01000A4F5C70BA4EE366FF621167037D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B38D6B62C9514B7F8565AF300200100001BE00000A7C2155AE4F868AAA5C31662F5BF653EF59224EA463DBFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請給我皮卡丘！\n作為代替我會給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳赫拉克羅斯！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n聽說皮卡丘會在\n3號野生特區出現！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7D66621176AE53614E18FF01000A4F5C70BA4EE366FF621167037D6600100003110000FF01014F6059B38D6B62C9514B7F8565AFFF0100100001BE01000A807D8AAA76AE53614E1867035728000A0033865F91CE751F7279534051FA73FEFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難、難不成\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳帶著皮卡丘嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果可以的話，\n請和我的赫拉克羅斯交換吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E3300196E34E0D6210000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B35E36845776AE53614E1855CEFF1F00100001BE01000A5982679C53EF4EE576848A71FF0C000A8ACB548C621176848D6B62C9514B7F8565AF4EA463DB5427FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D76840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳明知道我的請求，卻不和我交換？\n難道<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳只是來炫耀自己的皮卡丘的嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3660E77E59053621176848ACB6C42FF0C537B4E0D548C62114EA463DBFF1F000A96E3905300100003110000FF01014F6059B353EA662F4F8670AB800081EA5DF1768476AE53614E18768455CEFF1F00100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託了！\n就<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和我來交換吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A174E86FF01000A5C3100100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C62114F864EA463DB5427FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皮卡丘！\n歡迎你！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76AE53614E18FF01000A6B618FCE4F60FF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了紀念我們的相遇，\n我這就來使用雷之石～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E867D005FF562115011768476F89047FF0C000A621190195C314F864F7F752896F74E4B77F3FF5EFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "皮卡丘進化成\n雷丘了～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76AE53614E18903253166210000A96F74E184E86FF5EFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢圖鑑寫說\n雷丘牠……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n隨著電力的累積會變得具有攻擊性，\n有可能會襲擊訓練家……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF5922571694515BEB8AAA000A96F74E1872602026202600100001BE01000A96A8845796FB529B76847D2F7A4D67038B8A5F9751776709653B64CA6027FF0C000A670953EF80FD6703897264CA8A137DF45BB62026202600100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然後……除了雷之石之外，\n似乎還有各式各樣<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n能讓寶可夢進化的石頭。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "71365F8C2026202696644E8696F74E4B77F34E4B5916FF0C000A4F3C4E4E9084670954045F0F54046A2300100001BE00000A80FD8B935BF653EF592290325316768477F3982D300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "總、總之，\n謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7E3D30017E3D4E4BFF0C000A8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86300200100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也請幫我和瑪琪艾兒小姐打聲招呼！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĥ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F8ACB5E6B6211548C746A742A827E51525C0F59D06253807262DB547CFF0100100002011401250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "克羅嘶！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "514B7F855636FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    }
  ],
